msgid "Honestly, I don't even read books. Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1140_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess he ain't a big fan o' the topic.)"
msgstr "(No creo que le agrade mucho el tema)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1188_Ehama"
msgid "I used formulas like that at my old company. I was actually pretty good at them, too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1200_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he opened up a bit. Perfect.)"
msgstr "(Parece que ya se soltó más. Perfecto)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1248_Ehama"
msgid "The arts, huh...? I guess I listen to music, but I'm no art buff."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1260_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
