msgctxt "1272_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1320_Ehama"
msgid "Honestly... It really ticks me off! A lot of money being wasted."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1332_Ehama"
msgid "Who the hell do they think they are spending taxpayers' money like that?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1344_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1392_Ehama"
msgid "Bonuses, huh? It's nice to hear that word, especially after losing my job. Heheheh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1404_Ehama"
msgid "Oh yeah, I remember using my first bonus ever to buy a word processer that was new at the time. Ahh, those were the days..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1416_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he opened up a bit. Perfect.)"
msgstr "(Parece que ya se soltó más. Perfecto)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1464_Ehama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1476_Saejima"
msgid "(Definitely shouldn't have brought this up...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=4
msgctxt "1488_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1536_Ehama"
msgid "Hahahahaha! You are hilarious, Saejima-san! You tell the best jokes!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1548_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he opened up a bit. Perfect.)"
msgstr "(Parece que ya se soltó más. Perfecto)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1596_Ehama"
msgid "I haven't really been keeping up with the times. All of those studly celebrity types just piss me off."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1608_Ehama"
msgid "I'm not even cool enough to convince my wife to stay..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1620_Saejima"
msgid "(This probably wasn't the best topic...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1668_Ehama"
msgid "I haven't really been keeping up with the times. But I like all the big stars. You know, the really famous comedians..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1680_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=5
msgctxt "1692_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1740_Ehama"
msgid "He really is an interesting guy, isn't he? He built that dojo from scratch, all by himself. He seems like a really hard worker."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1752_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1800_Ehama"
msgid "I'm not an interesting person to talk about... I'm just a worthless businessman with no job."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1812_Saejima"
msgid "(This probably wasn't the best topic...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1860_Ehama"
msgid "I think you're something special, Saejima-san. I'm going to work hard so that I can be just like you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1872_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he's motivated now. Good.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1908_Saejima"
msgid "I don't mean to be pushy or nothin'... But shouldn't ya at least take that mask off while we're eatin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1920_Ehama"
msgid "Really...? Personally I've taken a real liking to it. Does it bother you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1932_Saejima"
msgid "No, it don't bother me, but..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1944_Ehama"
msgid "Good. I've always wanted to be like this masked wrestler called the Ferocious Tiger. I've wanted a mask of my own ever since I can remember."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1956_Saejima"
msgid "The Ferocious Tiger, huh? I think I remember that wrestler... Was popular among kids, too. Sorta had a hero thing goin' on, right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1968_Ehama"
msgid "That's right! I really like him. Maybe if I train really hard, I can be as strong as him someday..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1980_Saejima"
msgid "Huh. Why do ya like 'im so much?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=6
msgctxt "1992_Ehama"
msgid "Hehehe... Take a guess!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2004_Saejima"
msgid "His strength. A wrestler's gotta be strong."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2016_Ehama"
msgid "Well, you're half right. I guess I do like his strength as well."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2028_Ehama"
msgid "But the biggest reason that I look up to him is his strong sense of justice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2040_Ehama"
msgid "No matter how dirty his opponents fight, he always faces them fair and square. He has an admirable desire to always do what is right."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2052_Ehama"
msgid "I want to be like that someday..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2064_Saejima"
msgid "(So he wants to be a wrestler people look up to. I can get behind that.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2076_Saejima"
msgid "It's gotta be the mask. Ain't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2088_Ehama"
msgid "No... That's not it. I'm not saying that his mask isn't cool. But it's what's under the mask that makes him so special."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2100_Ehama"
msgid "The way that he fights fair and square in the name of justice. That's what makes him so cool."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2112_Ehama"
msgid "Did you think that I was the type of guy to judge people on their appearance alone? I resent that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2124_Saejima"
msgid "(I pissed 'im off. Guess that didn't go well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2136_Saejima"
msgid "It's his strong sense o' justice, ain't it? The way he faces villains is real cool."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2148_Ehama"
msgid "Exactly! That's right! I knew that you'd understand! It's great to finally meet someone who gets me!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2160_Ehama"
msgid "The Ferocious Tiger is the best, isn't he? Remember one time when he... *blah blah blah*"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2172_Saejima"
msgid "(That was one long story... But at least he opened up. And it looks like he's more motivated, too.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2184_Ehama"
msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "*suspiro*"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2196_Saejima"
msgid "What's the matter? What's that sigh for?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2208_Ehama"
msgid "I was just thinking about my wife and son leaving me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2220_Ehama"
msgid "When I think about it, I must have been a pretty lousy father. My wife took care of everything."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2232_Ehama"
msgid "And I <Italic>still</Italic> didn't carry out any of my family duties."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2244_Ehama"
msgid "I never did well at work either, and ended up getting laid off. Anyone in their right mind would have left me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=7
msgctxt "2256_Ehama"
msgid "I only realized how important my family was to me after they'd left. Aaah, I'm a failure as a man!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2268_Saejima"
msgid "If yer family is that important to ya... How's about tryin' to get 'em back?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2280_Ehama"
msgid "I've thought about it, trust me. But I'm sure that my wife and kid would never come back to me now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2292_Saejima"
msgid "That's why ya gotta change! Ain't that why you came to this dojo in the first place?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2304_Ehama"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "¡...!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2316_Saejima"
msgid "If ya change and ya work real hard, yer wife and kid might just decide to come back."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2328_Saejima"
msgid "Everybody fucks up at least once. It's what ya do after that counts. If you're a man, fight to win back what ya lost!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2340_Ehama"
msgid "...You're right! I'm going to go back to training. I'll train hard so that I can show everyone how I've changed."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2352_Saejima"
msgid "(That was some good advice, if I say so myself. And he's motivated now. That's good.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2364_Saejima"
msgid "You can sit there n' worry all ya want, but it ain't gonna change nothin'. Ya gotta think more positively."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2376_Ehama"
msgid "Positively...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2388_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. Sure ya lost a lot, but at least it gave you the chance to notice yer own mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2400_Saejima"
msgid "Consider this a good opportunity to rethink yer life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2412_Ehama"
msgid "You're right. If this hadn't happened to me, I probably would've continued to live my life as a no-good father and husband."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2424_Ehama"
msgid "They say failure breeds success. I have to use this as a chance to change myself. I have to become positive..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2436_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that was okay. Hope he feels a bit more motivated now.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2448_Saejima"
msgid "That ain't true. Don't go bad-mouthin' yerself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2460_Ehama"
msgid "Of course I should speak badly about myself! Saejima-san, you just don't get it. I don't need you to comfort me!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2472_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess my efforts backfired...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2484_Saejima"
msgid "By the way, you got a hobby or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2496_Ehama"
msgid "A hobby? Hm... If I had to choose, I would say listening to music."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2508_Saejima"
msgid "Don't tell me. Ya like... techno...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=8
msgctxt "2520_Ehama"
msgid "Yes! How did you know that!? Do you know a lot about techno?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2532_Saejima"
msgid "Hmph. Yeah, a little."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2544_Ehama"
msgid "Really!? That's a surprise!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2556_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah, techno, right? Just ain't heard that word in a long time. An old buddy o' mine used to do the jitterbug."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2568_Ehama"
msgid "Oh! You must be talking about the dance, right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2580_Saejima"
msgid "That's right. Ya know about the jitterbug too?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2592_Ehama"
msgid "Of course I do! Actually, I used to do the jitterbug myself!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2604_Saejima"
msgid "Huh. Now ain't that impressive! It's been ages since I thought about the jitterbug..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2616_Ehama"
msgid "Same for me. Oh man, it's so nice to be able to talk to someone my age. It feels like we could talk about anything!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2628_Saejima"
msgid "(Our bond's growin' stronger. And it looks like he's more motivated now.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2640_Saejima"
msgid "Hmph... 'Course I know. Techno... Short for technology..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2652_Ehama"
msgid "Um... Saejima-san... If you don't know what it is, you should just say so."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2664_Saejima"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Cierto..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2676_Saejima"
msgid "(Did he lose trust in me...?)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2688_Saejima"
msgid "Techno...? Never heard of it. I used to listen to folk."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2700_Ehama"
msgid "Folk music!? I love folk music. Come to think of it, we are from that generation, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2712_Ehama"
msgid "I used to love John Dover... Oh that's so nostalgic... I may still have the record at home. I'll check next time I go back."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2724_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2736_Saejima"
msgid "Heheh... That mask is startin' to look better on ya."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2748_Ehama"
msgid "Yes, I'm starting to feel like a hero when I wear it. Masks are actually pretty cool like that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2760_Ehama"
msgid "If I win that tournament and become a champion..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=9
msgctxt "2772_Ehama"
msgid "...will children look up to me?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2784_Saejima"
msgid "You're sure to be popular. Just like yer idol, the Ferocious Tiger."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2796_Ehama"
msgid "Really!? You really think so? If I become like the Ferocious Tiger one day... It would be a dream come true!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2808_Saejima"
msgid "And that's why ya gotta train hard."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2820_Ehama"
msgid "Hehe..."
msgstr "Je, je..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2832_Saejima"
msgid "(Is he even listenin' to me...?)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2844_Saejima"
msgid "That ain't likely. There ain't no kids at the Coliseum."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2856_Ehama"
msgid "Oh... Right. Haha... ha..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2868_Ehama"
msgid "I guess nobody will be watching, even when I'm fighting at my best..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2880_Ehama"
msgid "No matter how strong I get, no matter how much I change, my wife and kid will never watch me fight..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2892_Saejima"
msgid "(Shit... Looks like I got 'im depressed...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2904_Saejima"
msgid "Not by winnin' alone. Kids ain't gonna look up to someone just 'cause they're \"strong.\""
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2916_Saejima"
msgid "The reason you looked up to the Ferocious Tiger ain't just 'cause of his strength, right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2928_Ehama"
msgid "You're right... He always had a sense of justice, and he never ran from a fight. That's why I looked up to him so much."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2940_Ehama"
msgid "I get it now... I'm going to keep this in mind while I train so that I can inspire kids to dream big. Just like I did."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2952_Saejima"
msgid "(He sounds motivated. A fighter that shows kids they can dream, huh? That ain't bad at all.)"
msgstr ""

